### VSCode REST Client requests (install humao.rest-client extension)

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = {{token}}
@adminToken = {{adminToken}}

### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### Register student
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Login (student)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### Me (student)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List exams (student)
GET {{base}}/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Register for exam (student)
POST {{base}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examId": "{{examId}}"
}

### My registrations (student)
GET {{base}}/registrations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: List all registrations
GET {{base}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: Approve registration
PATCH {{base}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: Cancel registration
PATCH {{base}}/registrations/{{registrationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
